<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Carter-Wallace, Saga Petroleum, Corimon.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Carter-Wallace, Saga Petroleum, Corimon.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Tuesday Carter-Wallace Inc was unavailable for news pending.</p>
<p>Also, Saga Petroleum, class A and B, and Corimon SACA are unavailable for after-hours trading, the NYSE said.</p>
</text>
